    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d168">

                <pb facs="0186" n="174" sameAs="frus:frus1943v05/pg174"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">821.24/444: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Colombia</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Lane</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-03-28T15:15:00-05:00">March 28, 1943—3:15
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 10:28 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>554. Reference copy of time schedule enclosed with instruction no. 1123 of March
                        22<anchor n="8" xml:id="d168-f1"/> on Decentralization Plan. Deadline of May
                    15 for Import Recommendations covering various materials thought impracticable
                    with May 1 initiation of Plan “A”.<anchor n="9" xml:id="d168-f2"/> Should
                    deadline not be June 15?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Lane</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d168-f1" n="8" xml:id="d168-f1-content">
                <p>Not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d168-f2" n="9" xml:id="d168-f2-content">
                <p>Decentralization Plan A; for an outline of the plan, see circular airgram of
                    January 19, 8 p.m., <ref target="#pg106">p. 106</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
